": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bull trend leg from the bar 84 low 2358.62 to the bar 118 high 2850, with higher swing lows and higher swing highs; overlapping bars in bars 103-117 suggest a channel rather than a single spike.", "end_time_ms": 1790020799999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Recent breakout above the 2643.52/2700 area: bar 118 large bull bar to 2850, followed by bars 119-120 holding above 2700; the leg started from the bar 112 low 2568.16.", "end_time_ms": 1790020799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789891200000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A strong bear bar closing below the bar 118 low 2658.06 would weaken the bull breakout and could mark the start of a pullback or trading range.", "A close below the bar 112 low 2568.16 would break the most recent higher low and suggest the breakout failed, shifting the read toward trading-range.", "A bull bar closing above 2850 with follow-through would confirm the spike and favor continuation of the bull trend.", "Several bars of sideways trading between 2700 and 2850 with overlapping ranges would shift the phase from breakout-spike to channel or range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2404.17", "close_time_ms": 1789595999999, "high": "2411.77", "low": "2400.28", "open": "2410.13", "open_time_ms": 1789592400000, "volume": "1949272.699"}, {"close": "2392.19", "close_time_ms": 1789599599999, "high": "2404.61", "low": "2389.13", "open": "2404.18", "open_time_ms": 1789596000000, "volume": "2068552.579"}, {"close": "2416.57", "close_time_ms": 1789603199999, "high": "2420.01", "low": "2389.19", "open": "2392.19", "open_time_ms": 1789599600000, "volume": "2158549.037"}, {"close": "2418.23", "close_time_ms": 1789606799999, "high